    "text": "The set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, for which the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has real roots, is:",
